# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows/macOS 混合开发时的大量 CRLF 噪音
* text=auto

# Windows 脚本必须 CRLF 才能可靠执行
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不做任何转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.webp binary
# Live2D 模型与贴图：moc3 是二进制编译产物，tga 贴图同样不做换行转换
*.moc3 binary
*.tga binary
